  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.0.280\n\n## Changes (initial history)\n\n- fix(nes): refresh attributes when streaming background columns (#272) (`fab65e4`)\n- fix(runner/nes): shift screen-tall world up one tile row to clear bottom overscan (#271) (`4998e07`)\n- fix(runner): respect vertical map bounds via Camera.VerticalScrollMax() intrinsic (#270) (`edbfbfe`)\n- fix(runner/nes): restore full jump SFX so the NES jump no longer beeps (#269) (`4b705ed`)\n- runner: migrate to a stable stage1 map on the master 8-bit backend (#268) (`38869f7`)\n- SDKEXT-4/6/7: complete SDK plugin extensibility (epic #258) (#267) (`95f1668`)\n- Language/ABI: reject public pointer addressability forms (#266) (`7853164`)\n- Resolve #246: clarify raw target intrinsic quarantine (`03711d4`)\n- fix: route actor facade recognition through sdk roles (`06aac37`)\n- docs: define SDK plugin boundary (#255) (`fa50051`)\n- docs: classify target intrinsic taxonomy (`04e599c`)\n- docs: inventory compiler-owned SDK operations (#250) (`4c236f6`)\n- AF-5.8: harden actor TouchPlayer right-edge overlap (`5e59a5c`)\n- Clean up stale SDK alias test wording (`579ff70`)\n- Remove public SDK compatibility aliases (`dedd5f5`)\n- feat(nes): support PNG sprite overlays (#239) (`9e98d22`)\n- fix: align Game Boy vertical row streaming (`7973bd8`)\n- fix(gb): stop diagonal scroll corrupting the bottom rows on tall maps (#237) (`5042737`)\n- feat: tune runner run speed (`1e85672`)\n- fix(nes): restore the full pulse 1 state on SFX end (no duty/volume residue) (#235) (`d5a520a`)\n- fix(gb): play SFX on channel 1 with BGM priority (no music corruption) (#234) (`57e6317`)\n- NES: portable SFX action audio that plays cleanly over the BGM (#233) (`f6b295b`)\n- Projectiles: fix muzzle-flash glitch and add focused 2-shot cap samples (#232) (`201a323`)\n- Fix projectile follow-up issues (#231) (`a3bbe7c`)\n- feat(sdk): honor projectile Request direction (left/right) (#222) (#230) (`bf9279e`)\n- feat(sdk): portable projectile framework MVP (#220) (#228) (`cb1117b`)\n- runner: make the main loop readable via SimulatePlayer extraction (#221) (`529ab8c`)\n- feat: add NES DMC audio playback (#219) (`3042a8f`)\n- fix(codegen): preserve carry in 16-bit +=/-= with an i8 operand (nes/gb) (#218) (`d17a2f2`)\n- Remove loop keyword from language (#216) (`0e46c37`)\n- Resolve issues 210-214 (`26fb59c`)\n- chore: ignore local CodeGraph index (`1543c77`)\n- docs: validate source-only SDK library boundary (#209) (`74337fb`)\n- SDKAGN-5: rename SdkDotCallSyntax to generic QualifiedCallSyntax (#208) (`3389e5c`)\n- SDKAGN: make the compiler fully SDK-agnostic (retire SdkModuleRegistry) (#207) (`2717b86`)\n- SDKLIB-6: decouple complex SDK facades (#199) (`b61f1bf`)\n- SDKLIB-5: move resource facades to package contracts (#198) (`83fc04c`)\n- SDKLIB-4: retire simple runtime facade registry mappings (#197) (`19ae611`)\n- SDKLIB-3: consolidate target intrinsic descriptors (#196) (`148defd`)\n- SDKLIB-2: materialize Portable2D source package (#195) (`a136902`)\n- SDKLIB-7: guard against SDK API name leaks (#194) (`91fb89d`)\n- SDKLIB-1: load libraries from project manifests (#193) (`7607fda`)\n- feat: add physical namespace usings (#182) (`c6bfc88`)\n- feat: add qualified physical namespace names (#181) (`da5c4b9`)\n- feat(sdk): add manifests and physical namespaces (#180) (`7578c99`)\n- feat(sdk): make SDK imports registry-driven (#179) (`7bc866d`)\n- feat(sdk): add explicit Portable2D import (#178) (`b911f15`)\n- docs(AGENTS): make PR + merge the default way to land changes into master (#177) (`93877c8`)\n- lang: signed relational comparison for i8, removing the runner's signed-velocity-wrap hack (#176) (`67b0ef6`)\n- camera: make Camera.SetPosition walk to the requested position, removing the runner double-call (`4ff92f7`)\n",
